<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">Core Discharge</ansi>

<ansi fg="command">Core Discharge</ansi> is a boss ability used by the constructs of the Crash
Site (Warden-Prime and the Core Guardian). The construct's core flares
white-hot over a two-round windup — "the air begins to scream" — and
then unleashes a devastating blast against everyone in the room.

<ansi fg="yellow">Counterplay: </ansi>

  The windup can be INTERRUPTED — but only by specific tools, not by an
  ordinary knockdown. Land one of these on the construct while its core
  is charging and the discharge is cancelled:

    <ansi fg="command">throw flashbang</ansi>          a thrown grenade disrupts the core
    <ansi fg="command">cast neural-stun</ansi>         (or sensory-overload, kinetic-shove)

  A plain <ansi fg="command">bash</ansi> or <ansi fg="command">kick</ansi> will NOT interrupt it. Keep an interrupt in
  reserve — an undisrupted discharge can wipe an unprepared party.

